</div><div id="inner_content-2-11" class="ct-inner-content"><section id="section-2-39" class=" ct-section c-hero-xs"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><h2 id="headline-221-39" class="ct-headline c-h1 c-margin-bottom-m c-heading-light">Our 2025 Lunch &amp; Dinner Menu</h2><h2 id="headline-3-39" class="ct-headline c-h5 c-margin-bottom-m c-text-light">Brand New Dishes alongside our signature, fun take on Vietnamese Cuisine</h2><a id="link-4-39" class="ct-link c-transition c-btn-s" href="/book-now" target="_blank"><div id="text_block-5-39" class="ct-text-block c-margin-right-m">Book Now</div><div id="fancy_icon-6-39" class="ct-fancy-icon c-icon-dark-s"><svg id="svg-fancy_icon-6-39"><use xlink:href="#Lineariconsicon-arrow-right"></use></svg></div></a></div></section><section id="section-67-39" class=" ct-section c-bg-light"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><h1 id="headline-68-39" class="ct-headline c-h2 c-margin-bottom-m c-heading-dark">The most authentic Vietnamese flavours&nbsp;<br>combined with the best Australian produce.</h1><h5 id="headline-73-39" class="ct-headline c-margin-bottom-s c-h3">Small Plates<br></h5><div id="new_columns-124-39" class="ct-new-columns"><div id="div_block-125-39" class="ct-div-block"><div id="_rich_text-128-39" class="oxy-rich-text"><p><strong>BEEF IN BETEL LEAF (EA) gf|df|n</strong><br>CHILLI MAYO, PEANUT, CRACKER 9</p><p><strong>SOFT-SHELL CRAB (EA) df</strong><br>CRISPY, SRIRACHA MAYO, SMITH APPLE 12</p><p><strong>SEARED SCALLOP (EA) gf</strong><br>HONEY BUTTER, DESERT LIME, ONION OIL 10</p><p><strong>GUA BAO (EA) n</strong><br>CRISPY CRAB, PICKLE, SOY RELISH 14<br>TOFU, PICKLE, HERBS, SOY RELISH 9</p><p><strong>DUMPLINGS (4PCS) df</strong><br>CHOICE OF: PRAWN | VEGETABLE, <br>SOY JUS, CHILLI TRUFFLE OIL 16</p></div></div><div id="div_block-126-39" class="ct-div-block"><div id="_rich_text-134-39" class="oxy-rich-text"><p><strong>SPRING ROLLS (6PCS)</strong><br>CHOICE OF PRAWN | PORK |VEGETABLE LETTUCE, HERBS, NUOC CHAM 17</p><p><strong>BURNT BEETROOT v|n|df|gf</strong><br>WHIPPED TOFU, DESERT LIME, MACADAMIA, KALE CRISP, CHILLI OIL 17</p><p><strong>SOUTHERN FRIED CHICKEN df </strong><br>FENNEL PICKLE, SRIRACHA MAYO 16</p><p><strong>TOFU CRISP v</strong><br>HONEY BUTTER GLAZE, CRUNCHY SEAWEED, SCALLIONS CURL 18</p><p><strong>PRAWN &amp; PORK WONTONS (6PCS) </strong><br>CRISPY FRIED, PICKLE, SWEET CHILI SOY RELISH 16</p></div></div></div><h5 id="headline-283-225" class="ct-headline c-margin-bottom-s c-h3">Large Plates<br></h5><div id="new_columns-276-225" class="ct-new-columns"><div id="div_block-277-225" class="ct-div-block"><div id="_rich_text-278-225" class="oxy-rich-text"><p><strong>PORK RIB-EYE gf</strong><br>TAMARIND CARAMEL, FERMENTED CHILLI, AROMATIC COCONUT JUS 35</p><p><strong>MASSAMAN LAMB SHANK gf|n</strong><br>SEASONAL POTATOES, PINEAPPLE, BASIL, <br>SHALLOTS, RICH PEANUT AROMATIC 35</p><p><strong>DUCK CURRY (VO) gf|df </strong><br>CONFIT DUCK LEG, PINEAPPLE, EGGPLANT, AROMATIC COCONUT 35<br><br><strong>QT RICE (VO) gf|df</strong><br>BLACK TRUFFLE PASTE, PRAWN, EGG, <br>GARLIC CRISP, CORIANDER 33<br><br><strong>CHEF SIGNATURE</strong><br><br><strong>WHISKY FLAME CHICKEN gf </strong><br>(sharing style up to 3 person)<br>ROASTED, WHOLE FREE-RANGE COCKEREL, <br>CRISPY STICKY RICE CAKE, MISO &amp; LIME DIP 78<br><br></p></div></div><div id="div_block-279-225" class="ct-div-block"><div id="_rich_text-280-225" class="oxy-rich-text"><p><strong>PRAWN CARAMELIZED gf</strong><br>PORK LARD, CHILLI, GARLIC, <br>FISH SAUCE CARAMEL, HERBS 35</p><p><strong>TOSSED SCALLOPS (VO) gf</strong><br>MEDLEY VEGETABLES, HELLRICE CHILLI,<br>TRUFFLE BUTTER 42</p><p><strong>BBQ BEEF SHORT RIB gf</strong><br>NATIVE SPICE, BURNT BEETROOT, CORIANDER ZHOUG, MISO EMULSION 45<br><br><strong>300G STEAK gf</strong><br>WAGYU BOLAR BLADE, BRAISED MUSHROOM JUS, KALE CRISP 45</p><p><strong>WHOLE CRISPY BABY SNAPPER gf|df</strong><br>MEDLEY SLAW, CRISPY GARLIC, <br>TAMARIND CARAMEL 55</p></div></div></div><h5 id="headline-286-225" class="ct-headline c-margin-bottom-s c-h3">Sides &amp; Sweets<br></h5><div id="new_columns-287-225" class="ct-new-columns"><div id="div_block-288-225" class="ct-div-block"><div id="_rich_text-289-225" class="oxy-rich-text"><p>JASMINE RICE 4<br>SWEET POTATO FRIES, CHILLI MAYO 9<br>SLAW MIXED, HERBS, SESAME CRACKER 14<br><br><strong>SALAD + A BIT MORE</strong></p><p><strong>VIETNAMESE SLAW, HERBS, PEANUT, SESAME CRACKER, NUOC CHAM n|gf|df</strong><br>PRAWN | SOFT-SHELL CRAB | TOFU 30</p><p><strong>CRISPY BARRAMUNDI df</strong><br>DESERT LIME, APPLE, FRAGRANT HERBS,<br>PASSIONFRUIT NAM CHIM 38</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id="section-300-225" class=" ct-section c-bg-light"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><h1 id="headline-301-225" class="ct-headline c-h2 c-margin-bottom-m c-heading-dark">Curated Set Menus for Tables of 2 guests and more.</h1><div id="new_columns-304-225" class="ct-new-columns"><div id="div_block-305-225" class="ct-div-block"><h5 id="headline-303-225" class="ct-headline c-margin-bottom-s c-h3">CELEBRATION FEAST <br></h5><div id="_rich_text-306-225" class="oxy-rich-text"><p>(MIN 2 GUESTS) 79PP<br><br><strong>PRAWN SPRING ROLL</strong><br>LETTUCE, PICKLE, HERBS, NUOC CHAM</p><p><strong>SOUTHERN FRIED CHICKEN</strong><br>FENNEL PICKLE, SRIRACHA MAYO</p><p><strong>DUMPLING</strong><br>VEGETABLES, SOY JUS, CHILLI OIL</p><p><strong>VIETNAMSE SLAW</strong><br>PRAWN, HERBS, PEANUT, CRACKER</p><p><strong>PORK RIB-EYE</strong><br>TAMARIND CARAMEL, COCONUT JUS</p><p><strong>BARRAMUNDI CURRY</strong><br>MEDLEY VEGS, COCONUT BROTH</p><p><strong>SIDE</strong><br>UNLIMITED JASMINE RICE</p><p><strong>SWEET </strong><br><strong>BANANA FRITTER</strong><br>COCONUT ICE CREAM, CARAMEL</p><p><strong>*WHOLE TABLE MUST PARTICIPATE*</strong><br>WINE MATCHING 45PP</p></div></div><div id="div_block-334-225" class="ct-div-block"><h5 id="headline-335-225" class="ct-headline c-margin-bottom-s c-h3">QT SIGNATURE TASTING<br></h5><div id="_rich_text-336-225" class="oxy-rich-text"><p>(MIN 2 GUESTS) 119PP</p><p><strong>SEARED SCALLOP</strong><br>HONEY BUTTER, DESERT LIME, CHILLI OIL</p><p><strong>SAVOURY PANCAKE</strong><br>CRISP TUMERIC TUILE, GRILLED PRAWN</p><p><strong>BEEF IN BETEL LEAF</strong><br>SRIRACHA MAYO, PEANUT</p><p><strong>SPRING ROLL</strong><br>LETTUCE, HERBS, NUOC CHAM</p><p><strong>GUA BAO</strong><br>SOFT-SHELL CRAB, PICKLE, SOY RELISH</p><p><strong>BURNT BEETROOT</strong><br>WHIPPED TOFU, MACADAMIA, KALE</p><p><strong>CRISPY BARRAMUNDI</strong><br>DESERT LIME, PASSIONFRUIT NAM CHIM</p><p><strong>BBQ BEEF SHORT RIB</strong><br>MISO EMULSION, CORIANDER ZHOUG</p><p><strong>CALAMANSI NAMELAKA</strong><br>COCONUT CRISP, CITRUS COMPÔTE,<br>FRUIT CAVIAR</p><p><strong>*WHOLE TABLE MUST PARTICIPATE*</strong></p></div></div></div></div></section><div id="div_block-259-39" class="ct-div-block c-bg-light c-padding-m"></div></div><footer id="section-242-12" class=" ct-section c-bg-dark"><div class="ct-section-inner-wrap"><div id="div_block-243-12" class="ct-div-block c-columns-6 c-columns-l-2 c-columns-gap-l c-margin-bottom-l"><div id="div_block-244-12" class="ct-div-block c-col-span-2 c-margin-right-m"><img id="image-245-12" alt="" src="https://qtkitchen.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/logo_transparent_background.png" class="ct-image c-logo c-margin-bottom-m"><div id="text_block-246-12" class="ct-text-block c-text-s c-text-light">Incredible Vietnamese Fusion Cuisine in Glen Iris.&nbsp; Open from Lunch until late.&nbsp; Renown for bold flavours and hearty service from hospitality veterans.</div></div><div id="div_block-254-12" class="ct-div-block "><div id="text_block-255-12" class="ct-text-block c-margin-bottom-s c-heading-light">Who Are We</div><a id="link_text-256-12" class="ct-link-text c-footer-link-dark c-transition" href="/about-us">About Us</a><a id="link_text-257-12" class="ct-link-text c-footer-link-dark c-transition" href="/functions-in-glen-iris">Functions</a><a id="link_text-258-12" class="ct-link-te